(7569704, 1214914, 114285, '<td valign="top">This photo had a lot of potential but with a little bit more attention it could''ve been great instead of just alright. I wish the dog was looking the same way as the boy, I wish I could see a lake or a pond that the boy was fishing into and I wish the processing was more Norman Rockwell style. Kudos to your model though.</td>', 'This photo had a lot of potential but with a little bit more attention it could''ve been great instead of just alright. I wish the dog was looking the same way as the boy, I wish I could see a lake or a pond that the boy was fishing into and I wish the processing was more Norman Rockwell style. Kudos to your model though.', '2018-05-31 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569707, 1214966, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh what a tease, excellent patient dog you have there.  Looks like you may have used the cross hatch filter I could be wrong, not sure if many of his photos represented in that way, but you did a pretty good job considering.</td>', 'Oh what a tease, excellent patient dog you have there.  Looks like you may have used the cross hatch filter I could be wrong, not sure if many of his photos represented in that way, but you did a pretty good job considering.', '2018-05-31 22:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
