(7569841, 1214966, 182284, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> also i like the scene but not so keen on the processing used. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes tiny the dog is big and my hubby is thin, the dog is sitting a bit in front which makes her look so much larger but we don''t want a flat photo do we and I wasn''t sure how well the crosshatch would go over so I may not use that again. My Gracie (dog) is a mess and if you tease her too much she starts barking at you. She''s a Wiemador (1/2 lab and 1/2 WiemarainerI)<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on my photo. It feels good to break away from my normal right from the middle in challenges.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiny: also i like the scene but not so keen on the processing used.   Yes tiny the dog is big and my hubby is thin, the dog is sitting a bit in front which makes her look so much larger but we don''t want a flat photo do we and I wasn''t sure how well the crosshatch would go over so I may not use that again. My Gracie (dog) is a mess and if you tease her too much she starts barking at you. She''s a Wiemador (1/2 lab and 1/2 WiemarainerI) Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on my photo. It feels good to break away from my normal right from the middle in challenges.', '2018-06-01 09:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
